.vscode/**
.vscode-test/**
src/**
.gitignore
.yarnrc
vsc-extension-quickstart.md
**/tsconfig.json
**/eslint.config.mjs
**/*.map
**/*.ts
**/.vscode-test.*
# Load-bearing. bin/ holds the compiled server and is now ignored by git - CI builds it per
# platform and stages it here before packaging. vsce reads this file rather than .gitignore, so
# this negation is the only thing keeping the server inside the .vsix. Removing it ships an
# extension that cannot start.
!bin/**
